i canceled the job because Ranks > 3 are waiting for a message that they will never receive. So like this the process is never terminating.
To fix this problem, we should make the code more flexible => so to send a message to all ranks in the network (with MPI_Comm_size(MPI_COMM_WORLD, &size);)
